        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Dog breeds: Bavarian Hound, Bavarian Mountain Hound, Bloodhound, terriers, Oscar the Grouch's breed\n- Concepts: crossbreeding, breed ancestry\n\nFacts:\n- The Bavarian Mountain Hound is produced by crossing a Bavarian Hound with another dog breed.\n- The other dog breed used to produce a Bavarian Mountain Hound is descended from Bloodhounds.\n- Oscar the Grouch is an example of the other terrier breed mentioned in the chunk.\n- The terrier breed represented by Oscar the Grouch is not the same breed as the Bloodhound-descended dog used in the Bavarian Mountain Hound cross.",
